{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>מזין</b> — the meaning is <b>מאזין</b> (hearkens). That is, just as one adds alloy to silver and a crucible to gold to refine it, so YHWH examines the hearts and knows who is an evildoer and devises slander — he is 'upon the lips of a man.'"], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:16.233054067Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}